-10-02336" position="float"><label>Figure 3.</label><caption><p>Morphology (A) and particle size distribution (B) of RA loaded nanoparticles prepared by Colloidal Coating (pH 5.3).</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="ijms-10-02336f3"/></fig><fig id="f4-ijms-10-02336" position="float"><label>Figure 4.</label><caption><p>Bright Field Microscopy evalution of SK-N-SH morphology in samples untreated (negative control), treated with free RA (RA positive control) and with nanoparticles loaded with RA (VAM41 Nps).</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="ijms-10-02336f4"/></fig><table-wrap id="t1-ijms-10-02336" position="float"><label>Table 1.</label><caption><p>Correlation between pH, size and macroscopic appearance of nanoparticles suspensions prepared by Colloidal-Coating.</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th valign="middle" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>pH</bold></th><th valign="middle" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>Diameter (nm) number % &#x000b1; SD</bold></th><th valign="middle" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>Polydispersity Index</bold></th><th valign="middle" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>Macroscopic observations</bold></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">8</td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">-</td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">-</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">yellowish solution</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">7.5</td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">59 &#x000b1; 11</td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.1</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">slight yellowish milky like suspension</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">6.2</td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">n.d.</td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" col